<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_7_-_1_9_-_2_3_1_1_-_f_i_x_-_t_o_o_l_-_r_e_s_u_l_t_-_f_i_r_s_t_-_d_e_l_i_v_e_r_y_-_a_n_d_-_d_e_l_e_g_a_t_e_-_d_e_d_u_p.behavior_patch.ai-semantic-conversation-spine apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "ai-semantic-conversation-spine" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://ai-semantic-conversation-spine/requirements/tool-result-first-provider-delivery" } (
      <Requirement #tool-result-first-provider-delivery (
        <Statement ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS72>
        系统 SHALL 把新提交的 assistant tool call 与 matching tool result 的首次 provider delivery 建模为可持久恢复的显式事实；在该 pair 实际进入一次成功 provider request 之前，任何 compaction 或 persistence SHALL NOT 把结果替换为声称模型已经收到正文的 wrapper；provider failure、abort 与 recovery SHALL 保持其 pending，而 History、ToolCallDomain 和稳定 prompt/cache 前缀 SHALL 保持各自既有所有权。
        </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS72>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #tool-result-delivery-lifecycle { name = "Tool result first provider delivery lifecycle" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #fresh-large-result-survives-preflight-compaction [
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS73>
                matching assistant tool call 与完整 tool result SHALL 保留在该 provider request
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS73>
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS74>
                系统 SHALL NOT 生成声称该 pending 结果已被模型收到的 artifact wrapper
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS74>
              ] (
                <Given ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS75>
                旧历史已超过 cheap compaction 阈值，且当前轮刚产生一个仍可装入 provider 上限的大工具结果
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS75>
                <When ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS76>
                executor 在下一次 provider call 前应用 compaction
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS76>
              )>
              <Case #success-confirms-only-included-pairs [
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS77>
                系统 SHALL 只确认该 request 实际包含的 pending pair 为 delivered
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS77>
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS78>
                后续 compaction MAY 按既有预算外置这些 delivered 结果
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS78>
              ] (
                <Given ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS79>
                provider request 实际包含一个或多个 pending tool call/result pair
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS79>
                <When ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7A>
                provider completion 成功
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7A>
              )>
              <Case #failure-keeps-delivery-pending (
                <Given ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7B>
                包含 pending pair 的 provider call 失败、中止或未形成成功 completion
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7B>
                <When ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7C>
                系统再次构造 provider request或从 snapshot 恢复
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7C>
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7D>
                该 pair SHALL 仍有首次完整交付资格并继续受 compaction 保护
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7D>
              )>
              <Case #artifact-read-converges (
                <Given ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7E>
                模型读取一个已持久化的大文本 artifact，read 产生新的工具结果
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7E>
                <When ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7F>
                下一次 provider request 构造前应用 compaction
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7F>
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7G>
                read 结果 SHALL 至少完整交付一次，且 SHALL NOT 在首次交付前再次外置为下一层 artifact
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7G>
              )>
              <Case #legacy-history-remains-compatible (
                <Given ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7H>
                恢复的 legacy Conversation 含没有 delivery fact 的旧 tool result
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7H>
                <When ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7J>
                系统应用上下文预算
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7J>
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7K>
                旧结果 MAY 按既有 compaction 语义处理，系统 SHALL NOT 强制重投全部 legacy 历史
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7K>
              )>
              <Case #cache-prefix-remains-stable [
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7M>
                delivery 动态状态 SHALL 只影响 late conversation materialization 或 runtime metadata
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7M>
                <Then ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7N>
                系统 SHALL NOT 把该状态写入稳定 system instructions 或 provider cache key
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7N>
              ] (
                <Given ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7P>
                不同轮次具有不同 pending/delivered tool result 集合
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7P>
                <When ?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7Q>
                系统构造 stateless provider request
                </?01M05F1PMDCQ466H1QZ2J0JS7Q>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
